WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.569
Open Training and choose your assigned module.

00:00:04.819 --> 00:00:07.688
Read the published lesson, then use Mark this lesson

00:00:07.688 --> 00:00:09.282
read where it is available.

00:00:09.532 --> 00:00:13.295
Move between lessons and complete the practice, checklist and

00:00:13.295 --> 00:00:13.714
quiz.

00:00:13.964 --> 00:00:16.710
Check your saved progress and reviewer feedback.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.130
If your enrolment or published teaching is missing, ask

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:20.834
your leader.

00:00:21.084 --> 00:00:24.246
For help using the app itself, return to Pulse

00:00:24.246 --> 00:00:24.949
OS Help.
